το</span> when <b class=\"lex-tr\">preparations had been made</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.67</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τούτῳ ἄριστα παρεσκεύασται ζῆν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mx.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">248a</span> </span>; in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.100</span> </span>, for <span class=\"gk\">ὡς παρεσκευάδατο τοῖσι Ἕλλησι</span>, Reiske proposed <span class=\"gk\">παρεσκεύαστο</span>.</div></div>"}